``` mermaid [ระบบ Combat]
flowchart TD 
    Start([Start]) --> Input[/ Get player_hit , enemy_evasion /]
    Input --> D1{ player_hit >= enemy_evasion?}
    D1 --> |Yes| Hit[/Enemy HIT !!/] 
    D1 --> |No| Miss[/Miss ??/]
    Hit & Miss --> End([End])
```

``` mermaid  [ระบบ Level Up]
flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Input[/ รับ current_xp , xp_needed , level /]
    Input --> D1{current_xp >== xp_needed?}
    D1 --> |Yes| Level[level = level + 1 ]
    Level --> xp[xp_needed =  xp_needed x 1.5]
    xp --> cur[ current_xp = 0 ]
    cur --> nput
    D1 --> |No| nput[/ แสดง level และcurrent_xp /]
    nput --> End([End])
```
